["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和杨松琳考古算法变种史，并预演未来架构改进方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>纯线性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共识</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纯 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限无保证；Kimi、千问都收敛到每 3 层线性插 1 层全局注意力，而 MiniMax 从 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因为评测漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"118. 对李想的第二次3小时访谈：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文锋、VLA、能量、记忆、对抗人性、亲密关系、人类的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年内不会出现，只会先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断通用 agent 五年内不会出现，真正会出现的是 agentOS——各专业在上面开发自己的专业 agent。因为生产工具必须能行动、能替代专业工作，而不是给个建议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"贾樟柯×罗永浩！成为贾樟柯（上）\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-29-cn2d7912-一次被放鸽子的下午-一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9972a3ea5b348a4e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:45:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>一次被放鸽子的下午，一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一次赴约被放鸽子后，贾樟柯在电影院偶然看到《黄土地》,发现自己最熟悉却视而不见的家乡生活原来可以被电影这样讲述，当场决定要去拍电影。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贾樟柯</span><span class=\"tag\">导演成长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"117. 开源一段论文探索之旅：模型范式、Infra和数据、语言、多模态的完整变迁史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂：第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">论文精读</span><span class=\"tag\">模型范式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"名创优品叶国富×罗永浩！重塑线下购物，让人们重新爱上逛街！ SKU fine dining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-22-cn2d7912-名创优品老板-超市只分两种-卖产品的活-卖货架的死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c387de8b2a7bb5e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>名创优品老板：超市只分两种，卖产品的活，卖货架的死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">叶国富说，山姆和胖东来靠做好产品活下来，其他超市靠进场费、上架费赚钱，这套逻辑正是他收购永辉、复制胖东来模式的全部依据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线下零售</span><span class=\"tag\">IP运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"宋方金×罗永浩！故事必须有人讲下去 science fiction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-17-cn2d7912-编剧不该怕机器人像人-该怕人越来越像机器人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d1f8cd96251a093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:22:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>编剧不该怕机器人像人，该怕人越来越像机器人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宋方金说现在的AI写故事大纲已经超过六成编剧，真正的危机不是技术取代创作，而是创作者早已把自己写成套路机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">影视行业</span><span class=\"tag\">编剧生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影视飓风TIM×罗永浩！用影像打开世界的梦想家 OKR ENTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-10-cn2d7912-做内容赚不到规模化的钱-靠卖t恤一年卖出上百万件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8526f00042d68a45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>做内容赚不到规模化的钱，靠卖T恤一年卖出上百万件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">影视飓风内容本身没有规模效应，一期视频赚一期的钱；真正能复制、能卖出几十万到上百万件的是T恤和冲锋衣，这才是支撑公司的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒体变现</span><span class=\"tag\">内容规模化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"116. 吴明辉口述19年史：漫长的沉浮、痛苦急转、企业级Agentic Model、现实世界的数值游戏、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基础模型只要有两家以上就不可能赚钱，会像电价一样被卷成电费；真正的壁垒是别人没存下来的 context 数据，以及大厂因为晋升机制永远做不了的最后一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">数据壁垒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"周鸿祎×罗永浩！周鸿祎深度谈 AI！近四小时高密度输出 AGI PMF MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-24-cn2d7912-ai没法像互联网一样免费-因为token成本只增不减/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/244c36d13df4d6ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:32:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI没法像互联网一样免费，因为token成本只增不减</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做一个10分钟视频要烧掉约1000万token、花10到20块钱——周鸿祎认为任务越复杂AI的边际成本越高，靠广告或免费换规模的老路走不通，收费是迟早的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI商业模式</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"115. 对OpenAI姚顺雨3小时访谈：6年Agent研究、人与系统、吞噬的边界、既单极又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半场：通用方法已经有了，难的是找任务</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚顺雨说 AI 主线已从「造武器」进入「选战场」——方法终于通用了，但真正的瓶颈不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人脑子里的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"五条人之仁科×罗永浩！近五个小时的变态超长对谈！ X先生 时光列车 迪伦精神\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-10-cn2d7912-土味美学不是设计出来的-而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78ad6d4d665acca7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:37:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>土味美学不是设计出来的，而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说这套土味美学不是提前设计的风格策略，而是像希腊神庙的柱子褪色一样，被贫穷岁月自然磨出来的真实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">独立音乐</span><span class=\"tag\">乡土美学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"114. 与殷一、欧迪聊聊萨洛蒙：中国意外的增长阀门、小众越野跑与少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年没变，萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国越野跑核心人群十年前十万人，今年还是十万人，区别是老了十岁。萨洛蒙没丢专业线，靠女性拉新把会员从十万做到八百万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">户外运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何广智×罗永浩！何广智：我到长安了 callback cue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-01-cn2d7912-何广智-做好人比做坏人容易-因为伪装太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c82a199f8115741a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>何广智：做好人比做坏人容易，因为伪装太难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何广智说：选择当好人不是天性，是算准了做好事几乎必有回报，而当坏人必须八面玲珑、不能露一丝破绽，门槛太高、太难伪装了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脱口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">创作方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"113. 和杨植麟时隔1年的对话：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之脑和“站在无限的开端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像训模型：SFT 太多，团队就没有创造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟杨植麟讲：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告诉人该怎么做，太多，人就没有主观能动性；RL 只给奖励，但奖励定义不好，全队都会去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何小鹏×罗永浩！何小鹏讲述从财富自由奔赴无尽地狱模式的创业故事 soul side Tops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-26-cn2d7912-何小鹏-造车十年-没有一家中国车企真正拿到船票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f6e10cb84ed08b87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：造车十年，没有一家中国车企真正拿到船票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何小鹏说中国新能源车的淘汰赛大概五年内见分晓，最后大概留下五家，但眼下每一家、包括小鹏自己，都还没拿到那张船票。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">造车新势力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研发投入</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×罗永浩！四小时马拉松访谈！李想首度公开讲述 25 年创业之路 GTD PHEV e-power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-19-cn2d7912-李想-顶级企业家共同点不是选得准-而是反人性高频迭代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9a33a06a8261b5e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:56:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>李想：顶级企业家共同点不是选得准，而是反人性高频迭代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说顶级企业家选对赛道、能长期坚持只是入场门槛，真正拉开差距的是黄仁勋、字节、美团那种反人性的高频市场迭代速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"112. 和广密聊大模型季报：分化与收敛、全家桶与垂直整合、L4体验与挖矿窗口 Reward Hacking L4 体验 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖矿的，产品公司是炼矿的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖矿的窗口正在缩短：从两年到九个月再到三四个月。基础模型公司开始端到端做 Agent，应用公司的成本劣势是结构性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"111. 李一帆口述激光雷达11年创业史：你仔细想行业的机会来自哪？是国家、民族的机会 ASIC ITC POC Robotaxi Tier 1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-07-zhangxiaojun-激光雷达降价-99-5-靠的不是上量而是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a07079c1963cee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:08:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>激光雷达降价 99.5%，靠的不是上量而是设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硬件的降本不来自规模，来自设计能力：把几十万一台的激光雷达做进芯片，才可能从功能件变成安全件，最后变成标配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激光雷达</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"110. 逐段讲解Kimi K2报告并对照ChatGPT Agent、Qwen3-Coder等：“系统工程的力量” MCP KV Cache verifiable reward reward hacking persona partial rollout\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-30-zhangxiaojun-kimi-k2-把配方全公开了-但复现它仍是手艺活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4a70954860f9ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>Kimi K2 把配方全公开了，但复现它仍是手艺活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K2 报告把数据合成、可验证奖励、RL 基础设施的 recipe 全写出来了，但每个 prompt、每个参数都要调稳，本质是系统工程而非 idea。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Kimi K2</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"109. 机器人遭遇数据荒？与谢晨聊：仿真与合成数据、Meta天价收购和Alexandr Wang Sim2Real Real2Sim data pyramid cross embodiment acquihire scaling law moment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-15-zhangxiaojun-仿真不等于仿真器-机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17864fa8278d8825-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>仿真不等于仿真器：机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能还在 GPT-1 阶段，没找到 scaling law 的配方。真正卡住行业的是高质量物理资产和场景，而不是仿真器——所以做仿真器的人反而最不赚钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">合成数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"108. 余凯口述30年史：世界不止刀光剑影，是一部人来人往的江湖故事 PMF Cuda Baseband HMI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-07-07-zhangxiaojun-科学家创业最大的-bug-不知道客户是谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b30b49056fd22ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>科学家创业最大的 bug：不知道客户是谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">地平线前五年在空调、玩具、家电、汽车之间 360 度扫射，2019 年砍掉一半人、欧印汽车，才从乱打乱撞变成战略驱动的公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"107. 和梦秋的catch-up：创投挺无聊，也聊聊旅行读书和女性主义 sim2real general purpose agent reductive\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-29-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用没找到场景-deepseek-也没繁荣创业生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c74c419a6b9140d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0629</span></div>\n<h2>AI 应用没找到场景，DeepSeek 也没繁荣创业生态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">清流资本王梦秋的判断：资本寒冬没过去，DeepSeek 抹平了信息差却没造出新场景，通用 Agent 可能是伪命题，真正刚需的是垂直工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"106. 和王鹤聊，具身智能的学术边缘史和资本轰炸后的人为乱象 sim2real VLA perception action loop object goal navigation six dof pose\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-22-zhangxiaojun-机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术-是摇操和讲故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d36c7ae97ae40ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术，是摇操和讲故事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王鹤说这一代具身智能公司只有两条死路：长期漂着讲故事，或者每个场景从头重做。他押注合成数据，真实数据只占训练量的1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"105. 和奔驰王忻聊，产业大转折下的德国汽车、话语权和技术battle Tier 1 QNX Rule-based 端到端 SOA V2X\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-06-19-zhangxiaojun-奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41a98711cc822d74-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0619</span></div>\n<h2>奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tier 1 黑盒交付的时代结束了，主机厂要自己 operate 数据。中国团队不是把话语权夺过来的，是承诺、交付、建立信任换来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">智能驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>"]